<title>USA: American International Group Q3 rises.</title>
<headline>American International Group Q3 rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.56		    $1.33</p>
<p> Net			731,400		  630,700</p>
<p> Revs		   7,180,000		6,550,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 469,400		  474,100</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.51		    $3.87</p>
<p> Net		     2,127,00		1,836,600</p>
<p> Revs		  20,780,000	     19,010,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 471,500		  474,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding realized capital gains, net of taxes, 1996 Q3 income was $717.2 million, or $1.53 a share, compared with $619.4 million, or $1.30 a share, a year ago.</p>
<p>For the first nine months, income excluding realized capital gains, net of taxes, was $2.08 billion, or $4.42 a share, in 1996 compared with $1.80 bilion, or $3.80 a share, in 1995.</p>
</text>
